      },
      "message": "fix(motion): apply stock to leave axially and radially in 3D Pocket\n\nThe 3D Pocket ladder now probes the level target at plane Z minus\nthe stock allowance, with tool radius plus stock allowance XY erosion.\nThis protects top faces, shallow slopes, and floors against cutter contact.\nFlat floor discovery now includes floors across [bottom_z, top_z) when\nstock allowance is positive, and deduplicates floor levels within 1e-9 mm.\n\nPinned by pocket3d_stock_to_leave integration tests and updated catalog\ncase 3d/rough-finish.\n\nFixes #3669\nRefs #2392",
